    "/api/v1/workspaces/{wid}/runs": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createRun",
        "summary": "createRun",
        "description": "Operator/reviewer only. Root must belong to requested source scope and window. Max window 1h, max 1000 events before candidate filtering; 422 WINDOW_TOO_LARGE, never silently truncate. Freeze input IDs/watermark and source scope; late events need a new run. Poll Location; queued/running/completed/failed. Hybrid failure completes degraded=true, reason=ai_unavailable, effective_method=rule_only; requested mode remains hybrid.",
